ary care to people with diabetes</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31 (36.9)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Maintains registry of diabetes patients</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">30</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8 (26.7)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Provides case management</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">29 (34.5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Provides disease management</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">26 (31.0)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Screens for diabetes</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">83</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">61 (73.5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Screens for prediabetes</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">40 (47.6)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="col" colspan="3" rowspan="1"><bold>Essential service 8 &#x02014; assure</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Conducted a public and personal workforce assessment in last 3 years</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9 (10.7)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Anyone in LHD has attended a diabetes-related training or conference in last 3 years</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">85</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">42 (49.4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Has conducted trainings for health care providers in community in the last year</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8 (9.5)</td></tr><